from collections.abc import Callable

from furb.engine import Entry

def seed(names: dict[str, object], data: object) -> list[Entry]:
  """seed gives the entries that a life boots on from the data of a checkpoint, which the open of an engine hands it in the place of the checkpoint, before the entries that follow it, so an engine opens a checkpoint that an earlier engine of its major wrote.
  Each chain of the data is made again under its name, on its parent and with its label, as the operator makes it, and each name of a kind up to the highest that the data takes, which no entry carries, stays taken.
  Each open prompt of the data is made again through prompt under its name, and each chain that the data says paused is paused.
  Each chain with an open prompt opens paused while the seed binds it, and wakes after it unless the data says it was paused, so an open prompt asks its model again at once.
  Each act of the data with a value stands known on its chain with the words that made it and with that value and runs nothing.
  Each act of the data with a value is made before each open prompt, so a message that the operator sent on a done prompt while its chain was paused reads that prompt, and its model is asked once a wake comes in the later life.
  A rung of the operator on each chain awaits in turn a rung of each part of the birth that the fact carried of the chain holds, and tells what the checkpoint lost and cut, with each word that ran on it in the data of schema 1, and it runs no word again, so the model of the chain starts a cut word again in a turn that shows; the chain holds the turns of its fact carried as its prefix, and once the parts ran, that rung says a cut on the chain that holds no cut, which keeps each fact that the chain reads but what the birth told and did not debug, so a reader reads a birth by the fact carried that the cut keeps, and no clear, and a replay of the rung cuts nothing again.
  The fact carried of a chain holds the text of each value of the chain, then the parts of its birth in order: a word that binds each value from that text when the chain holds one, each word of its definitions, that word of the values again, which binds a value only when the module does not still hold the object that it bound first, and each life word whose act was open on it at the tip, so the word of the operator holds no text of a value or of a definition.
  seed reads the definitions that a checkpoint of an earlier build holds as one string as one word of definitions.
  The rung binds the definitions and the values of the chain before it says the cut, so a value that raises as it is bound leaves the turns of the chain whole.
  A part that raises at a birth tells its exception in a debug of the rung of the operator and stops no part after it, and the word of the values binds each value in a try of its own, so a value that raises loses only itself, a word of definitions that raises loses only what follows the raise in that word, and the second word of the values binds a value that the first could not bind, as one that names a class of the definitions, and gives a name that a definition bound again the value of the fact carried, while a value whose object the module still holds stays that object, which a definition took.
  The note of a birth names each name that the checkpoint lost and each value of the fact carried that the born life does not hold after the parts, and a birth that holds each such name and cut no act tells no note.
  The rung of the operator leaves no name of its own in the module of the chain after its last line, whatever raised, so no object of a birth stays held.
  A birth tells no turn of its own: the turns of a chain after it are its turns at the tip, and each act that a life word made lives again under a rung whose word is that life word.
  A birth makes again each life word whose act left an act of its own open or keeps a lasting ear after its done.
  A done prompt that a module names pauses no chain at a birth, so a word on it runs with no wake.
  A birth makes again each life word that asks the clock, and a life that inspects its record hears the clock silent: that clock ends as nothing takes it and the journal reads no drift, because the record holds no fact of it, so the turns are those of a life that answers the clock.
  """

def gathered(names: dict[str, object], define: Callable[[str], str], floor: dict[str, int]) -> dict:
  """gathered gives the data of a checkpoint of the life at its tip, which seed reads, as plain data that each build of the major reads: taken, chains and acts.
  taken gives the highest number of each kind that an act of a chain took, and at least the number that floor gives, since a later life makes no act again that an ear of the outside made.
  chains holds each chain of the life, a chain at rest among them, each with its parent, its label, its source, whether it is paused, its turns but the facts made, what define gives of each word that ran on it, as one string for each word that defines a name, in order, the text that binds each plain value of its module again, the names of the other values, the acts that it cut, each word that ran on it among them, and each life word of the standing whose rung stands in the lineage of an act whose ear still hears on it at the tip, an open act or a done act with a lasting ear, as lives.
  The definitions of a chain take only the words whose rung is an act, so no text that the chain heard, as a note in prose of a tell, and the word of a checkpoint parses, so a later life binds each value again.
  chains holds each chain whose ear still hears, after a number that no chain of the life holds too.
  The turns of a chain keep no reply that is not done, so a later life holds no reply that no ear of it takes.
  gathered reads the questions of the life alone, so the fact of an act of an earlier life that a carried turn holds raises nothing.
  chains holds each plain value of a chain whatever its size, and seed binds each from the fact carried of its chain, so a later life holds it exactly and no turn tells it.
  A value larger than one eval of the sandbox takes stands in chains as the texts of its parts, each after the parts that it names, so seed binds it equal, of the same types, and with the keys of each dict in the same order.
  acts holds the last stand, the last clock, each prompt and each command of a chain in chains, and each act of a verb that a value names: an act that is over with its value, an open prompt with its shape, its message, its actor and the ear that started it, and another act as cut, with a refusal that says why, so a later life holds each thread of a chain, a closed one too, and a prompt on it goes on.
  paused says whether a pause stands over the chain at the tip, and no prompt of it pauses it, so a later life goes on as the tip left it.
  gathered is a view: it makes nothing and says nothing.
  """
